# wrangler reads this file for local secrets, and `@cloudflare/vite-plugin` keeps
# that behaviour under `vite dev`. It is committed as an EXAMPLE only — copy it
# to `.dev.vars`, which is gitignored.
#
# It is empty because this unit needs no local secret today. The two flags that
# select the direct Rails transport are shell environment, not secrets: see
# `.env.example`.
